{"id": "section-body-22037", "title": "Sustained (> 30 Sec) Irregular Wide QRS Tachycardias", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "CARDIOVASCULAR DISEASE CONDITIONS", "Cardiac Arrhythmias/ Dysrhythmias", "Sustained (> 30 Sec) Irregular Wide QRS Tachycardias"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-22037", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Sustained (> 30 Sec) Irregular Wide QRS Tachycardias", "runs": [{"text": "Sustained"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(>"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "30"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Sec)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Irregular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Wide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "QRS"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Tachycardias"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "781"}}, {"id": "body-22038", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "They are usually due to atrial fibrillation with bundle branch block, or pre-excitation (WPW syndrome).", "runs": [{"text": "They"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usually"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "atrial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fibrillation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bundle"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "branch"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "block,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pre-excitation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(WPW"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome)."}]}, {"id": "body-22040", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-22041", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If the QRS complexes have a pattern of typical right or left bundle branch block, with a rate", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "QRS"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "complexes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "have"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pattern"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "typical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "right"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "left"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bundle"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "branch"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "block,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " rate"}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "781"}}, {"id": "body-22042", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "< less than 170/minute, treat as for atrial fibrillation. See the section on atrial fibrillation.", "runs": [{"text": "<"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "less"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "than"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "170/minute,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treat"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "atrial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fibrillation."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "See"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "section"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "atrial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fibrillation."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "781"}}, {"id": "body-22043", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If the rate is > 170 per minute, and/or the complexes are atypical or variable, the likely diagnosis is WPW syndrome with atrial fibrillation, conducting via the bypass tract, DC conversion.", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": ">"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "170"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "per"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "minute,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and/or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "complexes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "atypical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "variable,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "likely"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnosis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "WPW"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "syndrome"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with atrial fibrillation, conducting via the bypass tract, DC conversion."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "781"}}, {"id": "body-22045", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Referral: Refer patient to high care centre for further management including arrhythmia mapping and RFA", "runs": [{"text": "Referral:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Refer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "high"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "care"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "centre"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "further"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "including"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "arrhythmia"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mapping"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "RFA"}]}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Cardiovascular disease conditions", "start": "body-22037", "end": "body-22045"}}